00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.000
This is...

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.460
Episode 15 
Those Tears Fall in Space

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.340
I've found you, Gundam!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.320
<i>You defeated Desil. Impressive.</i>

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.700
<i>But...</i>

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.620
<i>Your mistake was coming inside the cage.</i>

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.540
So you're the leader?!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.420
You could say that!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:03:59.880
There!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:01.720
What?

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.060
Not bad, X-Rounder!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.900
I won't let you get away!

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.990
Has my luck finally run out?

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.540
Damn it!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:40.960
You saved me.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.930
A knight never abandons his comrades.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.140
Largan, the rest is up to you.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.390
Wait for me, Flit!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.400
Prioritize those with the least damage!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.570
There aren't many enemies left!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.240
Getting overexcited won't help!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.490
You gotta have spirit at times like this! {Spirit is important at times like this!}{misspelling lawl}

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.580
Spirit!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.340
He fell for it.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.050
Where am I?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.560
This is nothing!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.070
What?

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.700
Why?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.490
Why did you get Yurin involved in this?

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:51.160
Don't whine over just one sacrifice!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.700
She wasn't "just one sacrifice!"

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.880
Her name was Yurin!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.130
She was never supposed to be involved in this war!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.460
I don't care!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:07.800
People are dying for even less in our homeland!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.800
That doesn't mean you can hurt her!

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.390
Give her back...

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.390
Give me back Yurin!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.070
Yurin!{Athrun!}

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:30.990
Yurin!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.830
Flit!{Kira!}

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.000
Yurin!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.080
Yurin!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.250
Flit!

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.560
Don't dawdle!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.270
Get that ammunition loaded!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:00.020
We're running out of spare parts!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.730
Start taking parts off the badly damaged ones!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:03.860
But that's...

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.650
Flit, are you safe?

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.650
Never mind that! Do it somehow!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.820
Take this!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:20.870
I'm not done yet!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.920
This is the end for you, naive {inexperineced}X-Rounder. {naive sounds better}

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:36.760
Flit!

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:37.970
Damn it!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:57.950
That's...

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:58.950
the UE!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.760
I won't let you get away!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.300
Hey, wait!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.260
Flit!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.350
Jeez...

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.970
Are we fighting on the ground now?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.400
This is the fortress's{I dont think this shoud be capped} Command Room.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:25.860
Let's go.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.830
What should we do?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.370
We'll be torn apart before we can reach it!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.630
I think I can do it!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.300
Please do!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:05.480
A child?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.280
It's unlocked.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.990
Okay, let's go.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:15.780
Yes, sir!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:22.540
Don't move!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.290
Throw down your weapons and surrender.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.500
Open the gate to the reactor!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.550
They're all...

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.130
Did you not hear me?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.050
Open the reactor gate!

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:38.890
It's useless.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:42.560
They do not fear death.

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:45.680
Flit!

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.140
What are you doing here?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.570
He's human?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.780
Yes.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:00.570
Did you think we were alien monsters?

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.910
We did!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.160
You aren't human.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.580
You may look like one, but there's no way you're a human being!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.340
You killed people who did nothing wrong!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.380
Like my mom...

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:15.590
And Yurin...

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.300
You killed them all!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.220
Flit, calm down!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.510
Put down your gun.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:23.760
No.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.390
Give them weapons and they'll massacre each other.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.850
Just as I thought, the people of Earth are fools.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.940
Shut up, Yark Dole. {wasn't this Yark Dole before? derp}

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.940
You mean <i>the </i> Yark Dole?{double space, not sure if intentional}{tis}

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.490
It seems at least one of you has heard of me.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.910
You deal with weapons intelligence throughout the Earth Sphere

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.990
as the Dark Merchant Yark Dole, {ep 8 had Dark Merchant}

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.000
instigating dissent and rebellions everywhere you go.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.250
And that's not all.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.960
While I investigated you UE,

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.460
I found one more file about Yark Dole.{r->l?}

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.550
14 years ago.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.220
On the Day the Angel Fell, {this is like a name of an event, like D-Day or something, dont know about capsing The}

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:03.470
one man was found floating in space

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.140
near the remnants of the destroyed Colony Angel.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.680
That was you.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:14.940
You led your allies' mobile suits inside Colony Angel so they could attack it.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:19.400
Even though it was just a peaceful colony without a Federation base.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.700
My home was on Colony Angel.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.240
My family lived there.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.870
You took everything from me!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.830
I've come here for revenge.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.840
So that I could kill you all with my own hands.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:35.960
Revenge...

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.670
You came for such a boring reason?{boring}

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.090
A sad man.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.010
Then what do <i>you </i> fight for?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.970
What do we fight for?

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.850
All right, I'll tell you...

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.100
I'll tell you who the people you call the UE really are!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.230
The history of a cursed humanity!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.450
Jeez, where'd Flit go?

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.380
It's a...

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.970
h-human!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.770
One hundred and fifty years ago,

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:34.600
the population of the Earth Sphere expanded beyond its carrying capacity.. {carrying capacity, AP Biology FTW}

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:39.070
This was the beginning of the Mars Colonization Plan known as the "Mars Birthday."

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.240
The Mars Colonization Plan?

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:46.280
The Earth Federation constructed 16 experimental colonies in the Mars Sphere

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.280
and transferred people there.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:54.040
At the time, the Mars Sphere was thought of as a vast, new resource-rich location.

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.960
But we were wrong.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:03.420
The "Mars Rays" caused by its magnetic storms

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.800
caused deadly disease in 20% of the population.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.890
That is the reality of the Mars Sphere.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:11.720
The plan was a failure!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:15.350
They were never able to stop the spread of the disease,

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.520
and the entire population of settlers was wiped out...

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.440
No!

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.400
There were still many left!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:26.410
The Earth Federation covered up its faulty investigations,

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.410
and the people who were left were abandoned!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:34.040
They lived their lives in terror of the disease,

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:40.130
and created a new nation in the Mars Sphere so that they could return to Earth! {this whole idea doenst make sense}

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.800
And that is us, the "Veigans."{UE=Vegans. Fucking vegans.}

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.470
Veigan...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.470
That's the real name of the UE?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.890
You people who have it easy in the Earth Sphere...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.560
Can you hear our cries?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:58.850
Can you hear the cry of our souls as we long to return to our homeland?{This sounds like Tomino writing}

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:05.030
Is that why you destroyed the colony and killed so many people?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.660
What you're doing is a war of retribution.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.200
It's just revenge!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.740
No!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:16.120
Sir Ezelcant's aims are nothing so petty.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:21.170
His plan is beyond your comprehension!

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.590
There's no way you could ever understand it!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.340
So... So what?!

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:32.300
I don't care what your reason was, I'll never forgive you!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:33.510
Flit!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.430
Can you shoot a human?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.600
I can!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.980
You're not human!

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.820
Then shoot me.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.030
If you're prepared to carry that burden, that is. {you gonna carry that weight}

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:02.290
The likes of you will never be able to defy Sir Ezelcant.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.630
We will attain our goal.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.130
No, we must!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.300
Move!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:27.190
At least our souls can return to Earth...{Tominooooooo}

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.860
Isn't that so, Sir Ezelcant?

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.870
Now, I too can....

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.790
return to Earth...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.550
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.260
What's that?

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.470
Dad...

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.430
This alarm can't be...

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.430
You!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.390
Dad?

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.100
Dad!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.850
No...

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:05.360
Answer me!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.270
Dad!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.530
Dad!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.120
Damn you, Earthers!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.250
My name is {Inigo Montoya}Grodek Ainoa.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.630
I'm the one who killed your father.{REVERSE PRINCESS BRIDE!}{lol}

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.420
You're just like me.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.550
You will live a tragic life,

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.420
haunted by the ghost of revenge.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.930
Captain Grodek!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.300
All crew, withdraw!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.510
The fortress is going to explode.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:14.880
Mr. Woolf!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.300
Flit, hurry!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.090
Right!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:26.690
Captain.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.400
Are we ready?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.480
Awaiting orders, sir. {make this more military}

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:29.650
Good.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.280
Diva, disembarking! {ergh, maybe "pull out"}{don't come inside me!}

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.680
The UE fortress is sinking...

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.100
We did it!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.600
Darling...

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:09.650
Yeah, they finally did it.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:12.020
That kid really did it! {too much did it}

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.530
We won!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:21.660
Yeah, we're alive!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.870
Flit!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:33.250
<i>shinjiteita seigi ni kyou mo torawareru</i>

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:33.250
<i>Again today, you ponder the justice you believed in</i>

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:34.000
We were fighting other humans...

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:37.590
<i>daremo ga mayoinagara</i>

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:37.590
<i>We all wander aimlessly in life</i>

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.970
Is the war going to continue?

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:42.180
<i>koukai wo shite susundeyuku yo</i>

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:42.180
<i>and regret the choices that we made</i>

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.010
I think so.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:47.390
<i>itsuka kitto todoku kara</i>

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:47.390
<i>One day, I'm sure, my feelings will reach you</i>

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.100
Captain?

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.020
Everyone...

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:56.280
<i>kurayami ni wazuka ni nokoru</i>

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:56.280
<i>Your life shines faintly white</i>

00:18:56.280 --> 00:19:05.950
<i>masshiro ni kirameku kodou wa</i>

00:18:56.280 --> 00:19:05.950
<i>in the darkness around us</i>

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.200
Thank you.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:01.870
Captain.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:18.300
<i>negai wo koete tsuyoi manazashi ni naru</i>

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:18.300
<i>When it is more than a simple wish, it will be a glaring light</i>

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.970
Airi, Sara.

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:29.520
<i>kimi ga seou unmei ga kako no kioku wo mezamesaseru</i>

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:29.520
<i>The destiny you bear awakens memories from days past</i>

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.430
Can I rest a little now?

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:37.280
<i>kesenai kizu no kanashimi ga narihibiku</i>

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:37.280
<i>Sorrow echoes from wounds that will not heal</i>

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:47.700
<i>ikitsuzukeru tamashii ga shimei wo atae megutteiru</i>

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:47.700
<i>Your indomitable soul grants you a mission in life</i>

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.240
I'm back.

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:43.490
Welcome back, Papa.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:46.030
Welcome home, darling.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:55.500
<i>dare ni mo watasanai omoi tsuranuke</i>

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:55.500
<i>Let your dearly-held emotions break through</i>

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:08.390
<i>akiramezu ni mukatteikou</i>

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:08.390
<i>Let us face the future without hesitation</i>

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:01.510
Fli—

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.470
Yurin...

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.640
In the end... I couldn't do anything.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:15.810
I couldn't protect Yurin.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:19.730
I swore I'd become a savior and protect everyone, but...

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:32.500
I'm going to do it.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.840
I'm going to defeat the UE and become a savior!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:56.190
The battle to destroy the hidden UE fortress Ambat

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.860
would later become known as the "War of B{r}at{man} Extermination."{LOLWHAT}

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.860
It would change the future of the Earth Sphere forever.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:09.660
I threatened the crew of the Diva and forced them to go along with my plan.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.410
The entire operation is my responsibility.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:23.380
Captain Grodek was arrested and jailed as a traitor for violating military regulations,

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:29.760
despite having revealed the identity of the UE and won a major battle.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.350
Is he a traitor?

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.270
Or a hero?

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.230
After the trial, the Federation Government announced that the operation

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.570
had been performed at the discretion of the Federation High Command,

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:48.870
and the truth was covered up

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:55.120
just like it had been with the failed Mars Colonization Plan 150 years ago.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:59.960
Even though that foolish action was the start of all this...

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:05.010
{ED}

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:27.780
koboreochita namida ga kyou mo hoshi ni nari

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:27.780
The tears you've cried turn into stars today again

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:30.910
shizuka ni mimamotteiru

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:30.910
that quietly watch over you

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:37.580
tsugi no jidai he uketsugareteku sora wo sotto dakishimeta

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:37.580
You softly embraced the sky that lures you towards a new age

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:43.500
owaranai itami no oku de

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:43.500
Inside never-ending pain

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:49.930
ugokidasu hakanai kibou wa

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:49.930
the faint hope that was born

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:57.730
yukubeki michi wo shimeshi michibiiteiru

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:57.730
sheds a guiding light onto the path you must walk

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:01.560
kimi no naka no eiyuu ga

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:01.560
The hero inside you

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.690
mirai no kimi wo mezamesaseru

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.690
awakens your future self

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:08.780
kowashite umare

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:08.780
Destruction and birth

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:12.490
umarete wa mata kaeru shinka wo shite

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:12.490
Birth and rebirth, and constant evolution

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:18.160
kurikaeshi kawatteyuku yo osorenaide

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:18.160
Don't be afraid of change

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:20.870
hikari ushinattemo

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:20.870
Even if you lose the light

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:26.000
omoi tsunageru sono egao ni

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:26.000
your smile connects us

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:31.630
aeru hi made

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:31.630
until the day that we can meet

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.760
aeru hi made

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.760
until the day that we can meet

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:44.060
We're on course towards the Earth Sphere.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:46.110
The events at Ambat were unexpected.

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:49.400
It's nothing to worry about.

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:53.030
Sir Ezelcant's plan has just begun.

